@startuml 유명인_궁합보기

autonumber

actor User as U
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "CelebrityController\n(Flask API)" as CCT
participant "CelebrityCompatibilityService" as CCS
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC
database DB

U -> F: 유명인과 궁합 보기
F -> CCT: GET /api/v1/celebrities?page=&limit=
CCT -> CCS: get_celebrity_list(page, limit)
CCS -> DB: SELECT celebrities LIMIT/OFFSET
DB --> CCS: list
CCS --> CCT: list
CCT --> F: 200 list

U -> F: 특정 유명인 선택
F -> CCT: POST /api/v1/celebrities/{id}/compatibility {saju1}
CCT -> CCS: calculate_compatibility(user_saju, id)
CCS -> DB: SELECT celebrity by id (saju_data AS saju2)
DB --> CCS: saju2
CCS -> SC: calculate_compatibility(saju1, saju2, gender1, gender2)
SC --> CCS: scores
CCS --> CCT: result
CCT --> F: 200 result
F --> U: 결과 표시

@enduml


